# Next.js App Router Rule

- Default to Server Components; add `"use client"` only when needed.
- Keep API endpoints under `app/api/**/route.ts`.
- Use `zod` or equivalent schema validation for request payloads.
- Keep route handlers thin and call shared service modules for core logic.
- Use structured JSON responses and explicit HTTP status codes.

## OpenAI Integration Guardrails

- Call OpenAI only from server code (route handlers or server actions).
- Read provider key from `OPENAI_API_KEY`.
- Enforce request timeouts and basic rate limiting for conversion endpoints.
- Log operational metadata only; never log raw secrets or full user input by default.
